<title>HONG KONG: Allied Ind interim net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Allied Ind interim net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.4 gain   vs 4.47 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.35 gain  vs 16.45 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    11.09 gain vs 36.29 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     395.25     vs 233.09</p>
<p>    Company name		 Allied Industries International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Allied Industries, a subsidiary of Allied Group Ltd, is a property, building materials and manufacturing company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from write back of provision for liquidation cost for a subsidiary under liquidation and from sale of interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
